piece acidhouse
bpm 128
bars 64

# Two minutes of acid under offbeat stabs, with a pad holding the floor, a kit
# that changes as it goes, and a tune that arrives when the drums leave.
#
#   bars  1-8   kick, then hats. The pad whispers in at five
#   bars  9-16  clap, sub, shaker. The groove
#   bars 17-24  the acid, filter shut and opening across eight bars
#   bars 25-32  stabs. Hats get a fill, open hat on the and of four.
#               A kick roll over the last bar, into
#   bars 33-40  THE BREAKDOWN. Drums out. The stabs stop chopping and hold,
#               the pad swells, and the melody arrives — which is what a
#               breakdown is for and why the tune was kept back this long
#   bars 41-48  the build. Kick back, clap returning, another roll into
#   bars 49-56  the drop. Sixteenth hats, melody over the stabs, filter wide
#   bars 57-64  out. The kit goes, then the acid, then the tune, one chord
#
# Four things carry it and none of them is doing more than one job: the acid
# is the hook, the stabs are the pulse, the pad is the floor you only notice
# when it goes, and the melody is the only thing you could sing.

lane kick  clip=floor inst=kick root=A1 gain=0.56 len=0.4s
lane clap  clip=floor inst=hat  root=C-1 gain=0.322 len=0.16s send=0.35
lane hat   clip=floor inst=hat  root=C-1 gain=0.175 len=0.04s send=0.08 orbit=1.1/8/0/0/0/1
lane ohat  clip=floor inst=hat  root=C-1 gain=0.21 len=0.2s send=0.3 orbit=1.1/8/0.5/0/0/1
lane shake clip=floor inst=hat  root=C-1 gain=0.112 len=0.03s send=0.12 orbit=0.9/6/0.25/0/0/1
lane sub   clip=floor inst=bass root=A0  gain=0.469 len=1.6 duck

lane acid  clip=hook inst=bass    root=A1 gain=0.497 len=0.9 duck vel=8
lane stab1 clip=hook inst=strings root=A2 gain=0.91 len=1.6 send=0.3 vel=8
lane stab2 clip=hook inst=strings root=A2 gain=0.812 len=1.6 send=0.3 vel=8
lane stab3 clip=hook inst=strings root=A2 gain=0.763 len=1.6 send=0.35 vel=8

lane pad1  clip=air inst=strings root=A2 gain=1.19 len=30 send=0.5 orbit=2.4/32/0/0/0/1 vel=6
lane pad2  clip=air inst=strings root=A2 gain=1.01 len=30 send=0.55 orbit=2.4/32/0.5/0/0/1 vel=6
lane lead  clip=air inst=glass   root=A4 gain=0.42 len=0.8 send=0.55 vel=8

grid floor bars 1-64
